# Gauntlet Loop capture output — regenerate with `npm run shot`, not worth versioning
docs/evidence/shots/

# Gauntlet Loop reference images — third-party and deliberately NOT committed.
# This repo is public, and these are other people's work: watermarked stock
# photography (Alamy, Getty), press screenshots (TheGamer), and copyrighted
# game art (Godus / 22cans). Using them locally as a quality bar is ordinary
# reference use; republishing them from a public repo is not, and git history
# makes that hard to walk back.
#
# Nothing is lost by ignoring them: critics read the files off disk, and
# docs/reference/OBSERVATIONS.md — which IS committed — records what each image
# shows and what the owner ruled it governs. That prose is the durable artifact.
# See docs/reference/README.md for how to restore them in a fresh clone.
docs/reference/*.png
docs/reference/*.jpg
docs/reference/*.jpeg
docs/reference/*.webp
docs/reference/*.avif
